  "body": "220m² of substantial concrete construction, spectacular harbour views and secure triple garaging.\r\n\r\nIf space, privacy and an exceptional outlook are high on your wish list, this substantial Orakei residence deserves your attention.\r\n\r\nPrivately positioned behind secure electronic gates, this impressive apartment offers an increasingly rare combination of generous proportions, solid concrete construction and breathtaking panoramic views across the Waitemata Harbour, Auckland city skyline and North Head.\r\n\r\nStep inside and immediately appreciate the sense of space. Beautiful timber flooring, impressive nine-foot stud heights and an abundance of natural light create an inviting sense of scale, while expansive open-plan living and dining areas provide flexibility for both everyday living and entertaining.\r\n\r\nThe well-appointed kitchen connects seamlessly with the living spaces, while large sliding doors open onto a sheltered, north-west-facing deck. Here, you can relax, entertain and enjoy the ever-changing harbour outlook, with spectacular sunsets and city lights providing an unforgettable backdrop.\r\n\r\nGenerous bedroom accommodation includes a private master retreat with walk-in wardrobe and ensuite, complemented by additional bedrooms and bathroom facilities.\r\n\r\nBeyond the apartment itself, the practical advantages are exceptional. Internal lift access, a spacious separate laundry, extensive storage and a secure triple lock-up garage with an additional lockable storage room deliver a level of convenience seldom found in apartment living.\r\n\r\nWhether you're looking to downsize without compromising on space, secure a substantial city-fringe residence or enjoy an easy-care lock-and-leave lifestyle, this is an opportunity worth exploring.\r\n\r\nSpace, security, spectacular views and an enviable Orakei address - come and discover the difference.",
